ACCUMULO-3291 Use target instead of /tmp

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the use of the `/tmp` directory for temporary files in tests, which can lead to conflicts and issues when multiple tests are run in parallel or in different environments, as `/tmp` is a shared space that may be cleaned up or modified by other processes. This can result in tests failing due to unexpected file states or missing files.

